plan_ai_prompt:
Convert this fuel plan into a FuelSteps schedule for my Garmin. Reply with the import text only: one item per line, each line ending in ;

name;
km or min;
step;
step;
…

A step is "[Nx] size [text] [carbsg] [caf]" (size = km or minutes after the previous moment, Nx = repeat N times) or "@position [text] [carbsg] [caf]" (position from the start, no repeat). Grams always with g (25g); a number without g is part of the name (Gel 100). caf marks caffeine. A first step 0 = before the start. Max 12 steps, name max 16 characters, whole text max 256 characters including line breaks.

Example:
Long run;
km;
0 Gel 25g;
10 Gel 25g;
3x5 Gel 25g caf;

Full reference: https://fuelsteps.com/llms-full.txt. Ask me if anything is unclear.
